        "chart_note": "<p>Weighed dry, as sold. Rice, pasta, wholemeal pasta, egg noodles and soba from Singapore's Health Promotion Board food composition database. Mee sua and bee hoon read from supermarket packs. Protein pasta from the manufacturer's published panel. ProTEGO® from its own nutrition panel. Other brands will vary a little.</p>",
        "table_heading": "Swap the staple. Here is exactly what changes.",
        "table_text": "",
        "col1_label": "Per 100g, dry",
        "them_label": "A normal noodle, rice or pasta",
        "us_label": "ProTEGO®",
